      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There shall be within the Department of Social Services a unit for homeless services, which shall be called the Department of Homeless Services. The unit shall be headed by a Deputy Commissioner of the Department of Social Services who shall have the title Commissioner of Homeless Services, and shall report to the Mayor through the Deputy Mayor designated by the Mayor with regard to all matters relating to this Order. The Commissioner of Homeless Services shall possess the qualifications of a Deputy Commissioner of Social Services as established pursuant to the Social Services Law.",
